{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S02的固定感受短词略密，局部扫读不如Y的右栏利落；但分时出现的提示避免了大量信息同时挤在屏幕上。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X用【】突出每段叙事的关键转折，观众不必逐字读完就能抓住主旨；感受提示又有大小层级和音乐时间点的区分，既能扫读，也能在听到相应乐句时获得具体感受。更重要的是，X保留了想念不等于想回去、怀念亲近不等于愿意再次忍受委屈等心理层次，人物从失落、动摇到接纳和重新向前的过程也更完整。Y的叙述更口语流畅，但部分心理矛盾和音乐细节被压平了。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "1c607702-1cf6-4c18-93a3-2a6e87fc51cf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T011021486473Z", "elapsed_seconds": 107.125, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T01:12:08.624477+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "a2066c7b81b5df79f47b007bf70a81d3e7982999eae10f2ca1e2285d06bf840f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachmen